{"id":"n75554-1-7","stage":4,"title":"조문 · 吊唁","scene":"社会与交往","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n75554-1-7-1","ko":"어제 유민이 아버지께서 돌아가셨대.","zh":"听说昨天裕敏的父亲去世了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"어제","meaning":"昨天，昨日","explanation":"어제：昨天，昨日","readings":[{"term":"어제","audio":"/audio/79c5ada11647bce64407.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67075","senseId":"1","lemma":"어제","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어제","audio":"/audio/79c5ada11647bce64407.mp3"}},{"text":"유민이","meaning":"裕敏","explanation":"유민：裕敏；이：名词后缀，构成派生名词。","readings":[{"term":"유민이","audio":"/audio/b0f813b33e356d859fe9.mp3"}],"sources":[],"surfaceReading":{"term":"유민이","audio":"/audio/b0f813b33e356d859fe9.mp3"}},{"text":"아버지께서","meaning":"父亲，爸爸","explanation":"아버지：父亲，爸爸；께서：이/가 的敬语形式，标记受到尊敬的主语。","readings":[{"term":"아버지","audio":"/audio/af4870c15b98485bf462.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71343","senseId":"1","lemma":"아버지","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아버지께서","audio":"/audio/e826a68a64d3d7144cf6.mp3"}},{"text":"돌아가셨대.","meaning":"去世，逝世","explanation":"돌아가다：去世，逝世；시：主语敬语，尊敬动作或状态的主体。；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；대：口语中转述听来的话，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"돌아가다","audio":"/audio/1152d7a56fb1600a5774.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74103","senseId":"7","lemma":"돌아가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"돌아가셨대","audio":"/audio/653c7dcb20e28510c820.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"79c5ada11647bce6","term":"어제","zh":"昨天，昨日","audio":"/audio/79c5ada11647bce64407.mp3","entryId":"67075","definition":"今天的前一天。","pronunciation":["어제"]},{"id":"af4870c15b98485b","term":"아버지","zh":"父亲，爸爸","audio":"/audio/af4870c15b98485bf462.mp3","entryId":"71343","definition":"用于指称或称呼生育自己的男子。","pronunciation":["아버지"]},{"id":"1152d7a56fb1600a","term":"돌아가다","zh":"去世，逝世","audio":"/audio/1152d7a56fb1600a5774.mp3","entryId":"74103","definition":"(尊称)死去。","pronunciation":["도라가다"]}],"audio":"/audio/057af22ca579cd1eb26f.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n